<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.8 points to 895.1 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.8 points to 895.1 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 2.8 points on Wednesday to 895.1, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Five of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the transport index losing most, down 11.3 points to 1,371.4.</p>
<p>Five indices gained, with banking index rising most, up 11.6 points to 1,251.7.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
